  "description": "# 🎗 Mystic Alliance\nEST. September 4, 2024 | Created on November 19, 2024\n## Who are we?\n \nMystic Alliance is a community-driven guild group, dedicated to exploring the vast expanse of **[IdleMMO]**. Our members are passionate players who value teamwork, strategy, and camaraderie. We strive to create a welcoming environment for players of all skill levels, fostering growth and collaboration.  \n\n## ⌛️ Raids \n- **1x** Lv. 70 raids - 15:30 (UTC+0/24h)\n\n## 🔆 Requirements\n- ### ⚔️ Any Level | non market classes Only\n- 🔔 Active participation in raids and challenges\n- 💬 Respectful communication and behaviour\n- 📑 Applications only via the Discord Server\n\n## 🎁 Benefits\n- 🤖 World boss notification bot\n- 🗂️ Collection of resources\n\n## 🏛 Guilds\n- Mystic Vanguard\n- Mystic Crusader\n- Mystic Dawn [Skiller]\n- Mystic Wayfarer [Trainer]\n- Mystic Abyss [Cursed]\n\n## ⭕️ Discord is mandatory\n#### https://discord.gg/Ndz4eNPECy\n\nVisit the server, enter the queue and\n# ❇️ JOIN US NOW",
